[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11762.15, "timestamp": "03:16:02", "text": "但后来奥利就像是“啊，见鬼”一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11765.349, "timestamp": "03:16:05", "text": "好啊，咱们走吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11767.67, "timestamp": "03:16:07", "text": "是啊，简直太疯狂了。但它就是这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11770.469, "timestamp": "03:16:10", "text": "很不幸，就像我用的那个视频一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11772.95, "timestamp": "03:16:12", "text": "我用的音乐是凯蒂"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11777.91, "timestamp": "03:16:17", "text": "佩里的《加州女孩》以及最近"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11780.87, "timestamp": "03:16:20", "text": "它收到了版权警告，就像是抄袭一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11785.19, "timestamp": "03:16:25", "text": "推特删除了这条帖子。嗯，所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11787.51, "timestamp": "03:16:27", "text": "就好像一切都消失了一样。就像那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11790.309, "timestamp": "03:16:30", "text": "现在媒体已经丢失了。我的天啊。除非我喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11793.67, "timestamp": "03:16:33", "text": "考虑一下转发，嗯，就像这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11796.229, "timestamp": "03:16:36", "text": "另一首歌，但我不知道。我只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11797.91, "timestamp": "03:16:37", "text": "不知道值不值得做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11800.389, "timestamp": "03:16:40", "text": "真是令人难过。看到它消失，真令人难过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11801.91, "timestamp": "03:16:41", "text": "你有这些文件，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11803.67, "timestamp": "03:16:43", "text": "视频。嗯，是的，是的，是的。就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11805.99, "timestamp": "03:16:45", "text": "文件都在那里。更像是……嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11807.83, "timestamp": "03:16:47", "text": "那篇帖子就像，你知道的，发的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11809.91, "timestamp": "03:16:49", "text": "就像在推特上发布的那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11811.99, "timestamp": "03:16:51", "text": "挺好的，但我仍然觉得它像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11813.67, "timestamp": "03:16:53", "text": "其他地方。我觉得我把它戴上了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11817.11, "timestamp": "03:16:57", "text": "Instagram 或 YouTube。我不知道。嗯，我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11819.59, "timestamp": "03:16:59", "text": "我真的不擅长在网上发帖。"}]